<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1.These Consolidated financial results of the Group include, the results of two subsidiaries located in India, three subsidiaries located outside India (together referred as the  Group ) and two associates. These financial results have been prepared in accordance with Ind-AS as prescribed under section 133 of Companies Act 2013 read with Rule 3 of the Companies Ind-As Rules 2015 and relevant amendment thereafter. The said financial results of the Group have been prepared in accordance with  Ind AS 110-Consolidated financial statements .   2.The above unaudited consolidated financial results of the Group for the quarter and nine months ended December 31, 2022 have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at their meeting held on 5.2.2023. The statutory auditors have conducted limited review of the same, pursuant to Regulation 33 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations 2015.   3.(i) Please refer result filed in pdf    3.(ii) Please refer result filed in pdf   4. Please refer result filed in pdf   5. Please refer result filed in pdf   6. Refer to the result filed in pdf.   7. The Group is engaged in one business segment only i.e. cement and cement related products.   8. During the June quarter, the management had re-assessed useful life of its captive power plants (CPP) having carrying value of Rs.31588.27 lacs on the basis of technical evaluation, economic effectiveness and tests. Accordingly, the Company had estimated that its CPP life would be ranging between 15-20 years (Initial life estimated was 40 years). Consequently, an additional depreciation of Rs. 1,409.52 lacs and Rs. 4426.70 lacs has been recorded during the quarter ended Dec 31, 2022 and nine months ended Dec 31, 2022 respectively.   9.Jaykaycem (Central) Limited, the WOS of the Company has successfully commenced cement Greenfield Grinding capacity of 2 MnTPA on Nov 25, 2022 at Hamirpur, UP and has successfully commenced clinkerisation on Dec 03, 2022 at Panna, MP.   10.The Company has acquired a paint Company Acro Paints Ltd. on Jan 06, 2023 through its wholly owned subsidiary JK Paints and Coatings Ltd. acquiring 60 per. controlling stake in the company on first cut-off date on Jan 06, 2023 and remaining 40 per. shall be acquired over a period of 12 months.   11.Please refer result filed in pdf</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
